<%- include('partials/header', { title: 'Forgot password — Inicio Diary', user: null }) %>

<%#
  Deliberately not a "check your inbox" screen.

  No mail provider is configured, so a self-serve email reset would promise
  something the app cannot deliver -- the same failure the OTP honesty work
  already fixed once, where a code was announced as sent when nothing left the
  building. Staff passwords are reset by an admin, and this page says exactly
  that, tells you who to ask, and sets the expectation for what arrives.
%>

<div class="min-h-[70vh] flex items-center justify-center">
  <div class="w-full max-w-md bg-white rounded-3xl border border-slate-200/70 shadow-pop p-8 sm:p-9">
    <img src="/public/icons/logo-header.png" alt="Inicio Diary" class="h-9 w-auto mb-7" />

    <h1 class="font-display text-[22px] font-bold text-slate-900 tracking-tight mb-2">Forgot your password?</h1>
    <p class="text-sm text-slate-600 leading-relaxed mb-6">
      Staff and client passwords are reset by a research manager rather than by email.
      Ask whoever set up your account and they can issue a new one from Admin &rarr; Users.
    </p>

    <div class="rounded-xl border border-slate-200 bg-slate-50 p-4 text-sm">
      <div class="font-mono text-[10px] uppercase tracking-[0.09em] text-slate-500 mb-1.5">What happens</div>
      <ol class="space-y-1.5 text-slate-600 list-decimal list-inside">
        <li>They issue you a temporary password.</li>
        <li>You sign in with it here.</li>
        <li>You&rsquo;re asked to set your own straight away.</li>
      </ol>
    </div>

    <p class="text-xs text-slate-400 mt-5 leading-relaxed">
      Respondents don&rsquo;t use this page &mdash; they sign in with a one-time code sent to their
      phone. If you&rsquo;re taking part in a study, use the link you were sent.
    </p>

    <a href="/login" class="mt-7 w-full inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2 bg-brand-700 text-white rounded-xl py-3 font-semibold text-sm hover:bg-brand-600 transition shadow-card">
      Back to sign in
    </a>
  </div>
</div>

<%- include('partials/footer') %>
